<title>12mm Pistol</title>
<link>http://xs.xploder.net/xploder/xploderui.asp?un=xdnv2&amp;platformid=1&amp;tab=gc&amp;gameid=14904</link>
<description>Trained for picking up the pistol on the start screen.. Thought it might be a bitfield for weapons, but it's not  it's an array of bytes. Kept picking up the gun, training, restarting level, training etc.. Until I'd found the guna data. Then had to work out where the ammo was stored. Then noticed that the frontend uses this RAM for movie playback !!, so used the 'E' codes to see if the ammo count for that gun is zero.. If it is, unlock the gun and fill it's ammo.</description>
